*%==== Resolution ============================================
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200dpi/HQ1200 (2400x600): "<</HWResolution[1200 1200]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*%==== Media Type ============================================
*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: PLAIN
*MediaType PLAIN/Plain Paper: "<</MediaType(PLAIN)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType THIN/Thin Paper: "<</MediaType(THIN)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType THICK/Thick Paper: "<</MediaType(THICK)>>setpagedevice"
